    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Using property of integral&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Adding equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi m